  "title": "Listening Post",
  "briefing": "The old colony relay on the Frostline highlands still holds Cairn's planetary survey: every deep lode, mapped. Oversight needs fifteen minutes to pull it into the network. The Crucible knows. Its columns are already moving from the east and the south, and they will come through your base to reach the Relay in the north-west corner. Keep it standing until the upload completes; builders can repair it.",
