    "Relay lost. The survey is gone with it.",
    "Upload started. Fifteen minutes. Keep the Relay alive.",
    "Columns will come from the east and the south. Order a builder to assist the Relay to repair it.",
    "Upload at one third.",
    "Two thirds. They know what we're taking.",
    "Final minute. Hold.",
    "Contact east. Light column.",
    "Contact south.",
    "Anvils from the east.",
    "Mortars in the southern column. Kill them before they settle.",
    "Two columns. Both fronts.",
    "Artillery to the south. It outranges your turrets.",
    "Heavy column, east.",
    "Everything they have left is moving.",
    "Last push. Both sides.",
    "Upload complete. We know where every deep lode on Cairn lies."
